#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:40
msgid "AI 智能助手"
msgstr "AI Smart Assistant"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:41
msgid "智能对话"
msgstr "Smart Chat"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:41
msgid "数据查询"
msgstr "Data Query"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:41
msgid "自动翻译"
msgstr "Auto Translation"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:41 app/data/features_guide_data.py:52
msgid "表单创建"
msgstr "Form Creation"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:42
msgid "内置 AI 聊天助手，支持自然语言查询业务数据、自动翻译、辅助创建表单，让日常工作更高效。"
msgstr ""
"Built-in AI chat assistant supporting natural language business data "
"queries, auto-translation, and form creation assistance."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:44
msgid ""
"PMA 现已集成 AI 智能助手，您可以在系统内直接与 AI "
"进行对话。无论是查询客户信息、项目进度，还是分析销售数据，只需用自然语言描述需求，AI 即可快速给出答案。"
msgstr ""
"PMA now integrates an AI Smart Assistant for direct in-system "
"conversations. Whether querying customer information, project progress, "
"or analyzing sales data, simply describe your needs in natural language "
"and AI will quickly provide answers."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:45
msgid "AI 助手支持自动识别对话语言并进行翻译，方便中英文环境下的沟通协作。当您在聊天中 @AI 时，助手会自动参与对话并提供智能回复。"
msgstr ""
"The AI assistant supports automatic language detection and translation "
"for Chinese-English collaboration. When you @AI in chat, the assistant "
"automatically joins the conversation with intelligent responses."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:46
msgid "此外，AI 助手还能辅助创建报价单、项目等表单，通过对话式交互引导您完成复杂的数据录入工作。"
msgstr ""
"Additionally, the AI assistant helps create quotations, projects, and "
"other forms through conversational interaction, guiding you through "
"complex data entry."

# ===== 新功能说明书 - 场景轮播标题与描述 =====
#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:49
msgid "快速查询"
msgstr "Quick Query"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:49
msgid "用自然语言提问，如\"上个月我负责的项目有哪些？\"，AI 即时返回结果。"
msgstr ""
"Ask in natural language, e.g. \"What projects was I responsible for last "
"month?\", and AI returns results instantly."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:50
msgid "数据分析"
msgstr "Data Analysis"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:50
msgid "询问业务数据指标，如\"今年Q1的客户活跃度是多少？\"，获取数据洞察。"
msgstr ""
"Ask about business metrics, e.g. \"What's the customer activity rate for "
"Q1?\", to get data insights."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:51
msgid "翻译协助"
msgstr "Translation Help"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:51
msgid "在中英文对话中自动识别语言并翻译消息内容，跨语言沟通无障碍。"
msgstr ""
"Auto-detect language and translate messages in Chinese-English "
"conversations for seamless cross-language communication."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:52
msgid "通过对话式交互引导创建报价单、项目等表单，简化复杂数据录入。"
msgstr ""
"Create quotations, projects and other forms through conversational "
"guidance, simplifying complex data entry."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:54
msgid "点击顶部导航栏右侧的聊天图标，或使用分屏模式打开 AI 面板"
msgstr ""
"Click the chat icon on the top navigation bar, or use split-screen mode "
"to open the AI panel"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:56
msgid "点击导航栏右上角的聊天图标打开聊天面板"
msgstr "Click the chat icon in the top-right corner to open the chat panel"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:57
msgid "在输入框中输入您的问题或需求"
msgstr "Type your question or request in the input box"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:58
msgid "AI 会实时流式返回回答，支持 Markdown 格式"
msgstr "AI streams responses in real-time with Markdown formatting support"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:59
msgid "如需切换 AI 模型，可在面板顶部选择不同的 AI 提供商"
msgstr ""
"To switch AI models, select a different AI provider at the top of the "
"panel"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:68
msgid "积分系统"
msgstr "Points System"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:69
msgid "业绩积分"
msgstr "Performance Points"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:69
msgid "引用系数"
msgstr "Citation Coefficient"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:69
msgid "排行榜"
msgstr "Leaderboard"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:69
msgid "产品评分"
msgstr "Product Rating"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:70
msgid "基于业务贡献的积分激励体系，自动计算报价产品积分，实时显示个人积分排名。"
msgstr ""
"A contribution-based points incentive system that auto-calculates "
"quotation product points and displays real-time personal rankings."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:72
msgid "积分系统根据您的业务贡献自动计算积分。每当您创建或更新报价单时，系统会根据报价中产品的引用系数自动计算并记录积分。"
msgstr ""
"The points system automatically calculates points based on your business "
"contributions. When you create or update quotations, the system auto-"
"calculates and records points based on product citation coefficients."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:73
msgid "每个产品都有对应的积分系数（引用系数），高价值或战略重点产品的系数更高。这意味着推广重点产品能获得更多积分奖励。"
msgstr ""
"Each product has a corresponding points coefficient (citation "
"coefficient), with higher values for strategic products. Promoting key "
"products earns more point rewards."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:74
msgid "积分以年度为周期，您可以在导航栏实时查看当前积分，也可以查看年度积分排行榜，了解自己在团队中的排名。"
msgstr ""
"Points reset annually. You can view your current points in the navigation"
" bar and check the annual leaderboard for team rankings."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:77
msgid "查看积分"
msgstr "View Points"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:77
msgid "导航栏顶部实时显示当前年度积分，随时掌握自己的业绩表现。"
msgstr ""
"Real-time current year points displayed in the top navigation bar, always"
" track your performance."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:78
msgid "了解排名"
msgstr "Check Rankings"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:78
msgid "查看积分排行榜，了解自己在团队中的位置和差距。"
msgstr "View the leaderboard to understand your position and gap within the team."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:79
msgid "策略参考"
msgstr "Strategic Reference"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:79
msgid "根据产品积分系数选择推广重点，高系数产品带来更多积分奖励。"
msgstr ""
"Choose promotion focus based on product point coefficients; high-"
"coefficient products earn more rewards."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:80
msgid "业绩激励"
msgstr "Performance Incentive"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:80
msgid "积分作为绩效考核的参考指标之一，激励业务积极性。"
msgstr ""
"Points serve as a performance evaluation metric, motivating business "
"initiative."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:82
msgid "导航栏顶部显示积分徽章，点击可查看积分详情"
msgstr ""
"Points badge displayed at the top of the navigation bar; click to view "
"details"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:84
msgid "在导航栏顶部查看您的当前积分"
msgstr "View your current points at the top of the navigation bar"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:85
msgid "创建报价单并添加产品，系统自动计算积分"
msgstr "Create a quotation and add products; the system auto-calculates points"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:86
msgid "提交报价后积分自动记入您的账户"
msgstr ""
"Points are automatically credited to your account after submitting a "
"quotation"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:87
msgid "查看排行榜了解团队积分排名"
msgstr "Check the leaderboard for team point rankings"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:96
msgid "资源池与访问申请"
msgstr "Resource Pool & Access Requests"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:97
msgid "跨权限搜索"
msgstr "Cross-Permission Search"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:97
msgid "访问请求"
msgstr "Access Request"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:97
msgid "资源共享"
msgstr "Resource Sharing"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:97
msgid "权限审批"
msgstr "Permission Approval"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:98
msgid "突破权限边界的资源发现机制，支持跨权限搜索客户资源并发起访问申请。"
msgstr ""
"A resource discovery mechanism beyond permission boundaries, supporting "
"cross-permission customer search and access requests."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:100
msgid "资源池功能让您能够发现系统中超出个人权限范围的客户资源。当您搜索客户时，除了自己有权访问的数据外，还能看到其他同事管理的客户（以脱敏方式展示）。"
msgstr ""
"The resource pool enables you to discover customer resources beyond your "
"permissions. When searching, you can see customers managed by colleagues "
"(displayed in anonymized form) in addition to your own data."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:101
msgid "如果您发现某个客户与自己的业务相关，可以直接发起访问申请。申请会发送给该客户的负责人审批，审批通过后您即可获得查看权限。"
msgstr ""
"If you find a relevant customer, you can directly submit an access "
"request. The request goes to the customer's owner for approval, and you "
"gain viewing permission once approved."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:102
msgid "整个流程透明高效，既保护了数据安全，又促进了团队间的资源共享和业务协作。"
msgstr ""
"The entire process is transparent and efficient, protecting data security"
" while promoting resource sharing and business collaboration."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:105
msgid "发现潜在客户"
msgstr "Discover Potential Customers"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:105
msgid "搜索时发现其他同事管理的相关客户，锁定图标标识超出权限的资源。"
msgstr ""
"Discover related customers managed by colleagues during searches; lock "
"icons indicate resources beyond your permissions."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:106
msgid "跨部门协作"
msgstr "Cross-Department Collaboration"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:106
msgid "申请访问其他部门的客户资源，促进联合开发和业务协同。"
msgstr ""
"Request access to other departments' customer resources, promoting joint "
"development and business collaboration."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:107
msgid "资源整合"
msgstr "Resource Integration"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:107
msgid "通过搜索发现系统中已有的客户，避免重复录入和资源浪费。"
msgstr ""
"Discover existing customers through search to avoid duplicate entries and"
" resource waste."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:108 app/templates/base.html:447
#: app/templates/base.html:481 app/templates/user/permissions.html:4
#: app/templates/user/permissions.html:108
#: app/templates/user/role_permissions.html:4
#: app/templates/user/role_permissions.html:20
msgid "权限管理"
msgstr "Permission"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:108
msgid "客户负责人在线审批他人的访问请求，流程透明可追溯。"
msgstr ""
"Customer owners approve access requests online with a transparent and "
"traceable process."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:110
msgid "在客户列表页面搜索时，超出权限的结果会显示锁定图标"
msgstr ""
"When searching in the customer list, results beyond your permissions show"
" a lock icon"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:112
msgid "在客户搜索框输入关键词进行搜索"
msgstr "Enter keywords in the customer search box"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:113
msgid "搜索结果中带锁定图标的是超出权限的资源"
msgstr "Results with a lock icon are resources beyond your permissions"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:114
msgid "点击锁定图标或\"申请访问\"按钮发起申请"
msgstr "Click the lock icon or \"Request Access\" button to submit a request"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:115
msgid "填写申请理由并提交"
msgstr "Fill in the reason and submit"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:116
msgid "等待客户负责人审批，通过后自动获得访问权限"
msgstr ""
"Wait for the customer owner's approval; access is granted automatically "
"upon approval"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:125
msgid "分屏浏览与消息通知"
msgstr "Split Screen & Notifications"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:126
msgid "分屏浏览"
msgstr "Split Screen"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:126
msgid "@提醒"
msgstr "@Mentions"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:126
#: app/templates/components/tw_message_panel.html:99
#: app/templates/index.html:378 app/templates/macros/approval_macros.html:922
#: app/templates/macros/ui_helpers.html:8709
#: app/templates/macros/ui_helpers.html:8787 app/views/expense.py:394
#: app/views/expense.py:587 app/views/quotation.py:414
msgid "待审批"
msgstr "Pending Approval"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:126
msgid "待办事项"
msgstr "To-Do Items"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:127
msgid "50/50 分屏布局支持边聊天边工作，消息通知面板集中显示 @提醒和待办事项。"
msgstr ""
"50/50 split-screen layout for chatting while working, with a notification"
" panel for @mentions and to-do items."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:129
msgid "分屏浏览功能将页面分为左右两半：左侧是聊天面板，右侧是您正在浏览的业务页面。这样您可以一边与同事或 AI 沟通，一边查看客户信息或编辑报价单。"
msgstr ""
"Split-screen divides the page in half: chat panel on the left, business "
"page on the right. Chat with colleagues or AI while viewing customer "
"information or editing quotations."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:130
msgid "消息通知面板集中展示所有需要您关注的事项：@您的聊天消息、待审批的项目/报销单、即将到期的任务等。点击通知可直接跳转到对应页面。"
msgstr ""
"The notification panel displays all items requiring your attention: "
"@mentions, pending approvals for projects/expenses, upcoming task "
"deadlines, etc. Click notifications to jump directly to the relevant "
"page."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:131
msgid "分屏模式下导航栏会自动收窄，最大化利用屏幕空间。您可以随时切换分屏和全屏模式。"
msgstr ""
"In split-screen mode, the navigation bar auto-collapses to maximize "
"screen space. Switch between split and full-screen modes anytime."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:134
msgid "边聊边查"
msgstr "Chat & Browse"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:134
msgid "与同事讨论项目时同时查看项目详情，信息对照一目了然。"
msgstr ""
"View project details while discussing with colleagues, with information "
"comparison at a glance."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:135
msgid "AI 辅助"
msgstr "AI Assistance"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:135
msgid "一边使用 AI 助手获取信息，一边填写表单或编辑数据。"
msgstr ""
"Use the AI assistant for information while filling out forms or editing "
"data."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:136
msgid "消息追踪"
msgstr "Message Tracking"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:136
msgid "快速查看和处理 @提醒消息，不错过任何重要沟通。"
msgstr ""
"Quickly view and handle @mention messages, never miss important "
"communications."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:137
msgid "审批处理"
msgstr "Approval Processing"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:137
msgid "在通知面板中快速处理待审批事项，提升审批效率。"
msgstr ""
"Quickly handle pending approvals in the notification panel, improving "
"approval efficiency."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:139
msgid "点击导航栏的分屏图标切换分屏模式，点击铃铛图标打开消息面板"
msgstr ""
"Click the split-screen icon in the navigation bar, or the bell icon to "
"open the notification panel"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:141
msgid "点击导航栏右上角的分屏图标进入分屏模式"
msgstr ""
"Click the split-screen icon in the top-right corner to enter split-screen"
" mode"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:142
msgid "左侧聊天面板自动展开，右侧显示当前页面"
msgstr ""
"The left chat panel auto-expands while the right side shows the current "
"page"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:143
msgid "点击铃铛图标查看消息通知面板"
msgstr "Click the bell icon to view the notification panel"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:144
msgid "点击通知项可直接跳转到对应页面处理"
msgstr "Click notification items to jump directly to the relevant page"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:153
msgid "绩效仪表盘增强"
msgstr "Enhanced Performance Dashboard"

# 绩效仪表板标签页翻译
#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:154
#: app/templates/components/tw_performance_dashboard.html:28
msgid "目标达成"
msgstr "Goals"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:154
msgid "活跃度分析"
msgstr "Activity Analysis"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:154
#: app/templates/components/tw_performance_dashboard.html:31
#: app/templates/components/tw_performance_dashboard.html:1197
msgid "行业分布"
msgstr "Industry"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:154 app/data/features_guide_data.py:238
msgid "客户地图"
msgstr "Customer Map"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:155
msgid "全面升级的绩效仪表盘，新增目标达成率追踪、客户活跃度分析和行业分布图表。"
msgstr ""
"Fully upgraded performance dashboard with goal achievement tracking, "
"customer activity analysis, and industry distribution charts."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:157
msgid "绩效仪表盘经过全面升级，现在提供更丰富的数据可视化。首页仪表盘展示您的年度目标达成率、月度业绩趋势、客户活跃度等核心指标。"
msgstr ""
"The performance dashboard has been fully upgraded with richer data "
"visualizations. The homepage displays your annual goal achievement rate, "
"monthly performance trends, and customer activity metrics."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:158
msgid "新增的行业分布图表帮助您了解客户的行业构成，发现潜力行业。客户活跃度分析则追踪客户的互动频率，帮助您识别需要重点维护的客户。"
msgstr ""
"New industry distribution charts help you understand customer industry "
"composition and discover potential sectors. Customer activity analysis "
"tracks interaction frequency to identify clients needing attention."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:159
msgid "仪表盘支持按年份筛选，所有图表均支持交互操作，鼠标悬停可查看详细数据。性能方面进行了大幅优化，加载速度提升显著。"
msgstr ""
"The dashboard supports year filtering, all charts are interactive with "
"hover details, and performance has been significantly optimized for "
"faster loading."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:162
msgid "业绩追踪"
msgstr "Performance Tracking"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:162
msgid "实时查看年度/月度目标达成率，掌握业绩进展。"
msgstr ""
"View real-time annual/monthly goal achievement rates, track performance "
"progress."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:163
#: app/templates/product_analysis/tw_analysis.html:580
msgid "趋势分析"
msgstr "Trend Analysis"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:163
msgid "查看月度业绩趋势变化曲线，发现增长或下滑趋势。"
msgstr ""
"View monthly performance trend curves to identify growth or decline "
"patterns."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:164
msgid "客户分析"
msgstr "Customer Analysis"

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:164
msgid "了解客户的行业分布和活跃度，识别重点维护对象。"
msgstr ""
"Understand customer industry distribution and activity levels, identify "
"key accounts to maintain."

#: app/data/features_guide_data.py:165
